# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Deny by default, allow only what this repository publishes.
#
# A blocklist would have to name every build artefact, script and
# stray folder -- and miss one eventually. Once a file is pushed it
# stays in the git history even after it is deleted, so the safe
# direction is: ignore everything, then whitelist.
#
# Nothing below the allow-list should ever appear in this repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*

# git needs to be able to descend into directories
!*/

# --- published ---
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/**

